@startuml
actor User
participant FE
participant BE
participant DB

User -> FE : Open dashboard

FE -> BE : GET /files
BE -> BE : Validate JWT
BE -> DB : Fetch files owned by user\n(filter by owner_id = jwt.user_id)
DB --> BE : list of file records
BE --> FE : [\n  {\n    file_id,\n    filename,\n    enc_algo,\n    hash_algo,\n    file_hash,\n    file_size,\n    upload_date\n  }, ...\n]

note over BE : Server returns metadata only\nNo ciphertext is sent here

FE -> BE : GET /files/shared-with-me
BE -> BE : Validate JWT
BE -> DB : Fetch share entries\nwhere recipient_id = jwt.user_id
DB --> BE : list of shared file records
BE --> FE : [\n  {\n    file_id,\n    filename,\n    owner_email,\n    enc_algo,\n    hash_algo,\n    shared_date\n  }, ...\n]

FE --> User : Display owned files\n+ files shared with me
@enduml